  ],
  "abstract": "We use the Wilson renormalization group (RG) formulation to solve the \ufb01ne-tuning proce- dure needed in renormalization schemes breaking the gauge symmetry. To illustrate this method we systematically compute the non-invariant couplings of the ultraviolet action of the SU(2) pure Yang-Mills theory at one-loop order.",
